<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<div style="padding: 10px; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#1A1A1A;">

<p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px 0;">Dear {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</p>

<p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px 0;">
    We noticed that your direct debit authorisation is still pending. This is a friendly reminder to complete
    the setup at your earliest convenience.
</p>

<p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 24px 0;">
    Without this authorisation, we are unable to automatically collect your invoices. The setup
    takes only a few minutes and your bank details are handled securely.
</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 24px 0;">
    <tr>
        <td style="background-color:#003087;border-radius:4px;padding:0;">
            <a href="https://movingintelligence--dev.sandbox.my.site.com/hub/payment?token={{{Payment__c.externalId__c}}}"
               style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 28px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;
                      font-weight:bold;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;">
                Complete Direct Debit Authorisation
            </a>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>

<p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#555555;margin:0 0 16px 0;">
    Or copy this link into your browser:<br/>
    <a href="https://movingintelligence--dev.sandbox.my.site.com/hub/payment?token={{{Payment__c.externalId__c}}}" style="color:#003087;word-break:break-all;">https://movingintelligence--dev.sandbox.my.site.com/hub/payment?token={{{Payment__c.externalId__c}}}</a>
</p>

<hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #E0E0E0;margin:24px 0;" />

<p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#555555;margin:0 0 8px 0;">
    <strong>Payment reference:</strong> {{{Payment__c.Name}}}
</p>

<p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#555555;margin:0 0 24px 0;">
    If you have already completed this authorisation, please disregard this message.
    If you have questions, please contact our support team.
</p>

<p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 24px 0;">
    Kind regards,<br/>
    <strong>{{{Payment__c.Sender_Name__c}}}</strong>
</p>

<hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #E0E0E0;margin:24px 0;" />

<p style="font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#777777;margin:0 0 8px 0;">
    <strong>Do not share this email</strong><br/>
    This email contains a secure, one-time link to sign the document and is addressed specifically to you.
    Do not share this email or the link with anyone else.
</p>

<p style="font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#777777;margin:0 0 8px 0;">
    <strong>Questions about this document?</strong><br/>
    If you have any questions about the details or contents of the document, please contact us directly by email:
    {{{Payment__c.Sender_Email__c}}}
</p>

<p style="font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#777777;margin:0;">
    This message was sent by {{{Payment__c.Sender_Name__c}}}.
    If you do not wish to be contacted, please contact the sender of this request directly.
</p>

</div>
</body>
</html>
